dbase (["notes":({(["msg":"少林虽大, 却不收女弟子, 与地狱有何不同? 佛曰:\"我不入地狱, 谁入地狱?\" 俺既入佛门, 与入地狱也无两样, 不才也成一回佛, 哈哈哈哈....","author":"虚无","time":827727962,"title":"佛门与地狱",]),(["msg":"All account, which were created before March.1stand not used (not played) since that time , willbe deleted recently. The purpose was to maintiana reasobable system performance and availabilityto current and later players. So all ppls pleasesuicide -f all unused accounts to save our systemspace, let's together make this mud better :)","time":827864543,"author":"清平剑","title":"Very Important Notice:",]),(["msg":"Hi, cleansword:  :-)增加内力的补药吃多了不好. :) 那有和尚吃这么多补药?players are get lazy le.Make the Da-Huandan can only be eaten in an hour.lord.","author":"虚空","time":828517701,"title":"message for cleansword.",]),(["msg":"少林弟子, please eat in the 斋厅. You can eat without picking up the food and hulu. Please do carry the 少林弟子, please eat in the 斋厅. Y.","time":828994628,"author":"清天","title":"food",]),(["msg":"cleansword,清乐比丘说道：大师资质不够，不能进入藏经楼。my int is 33...but still 资质不够 !! what do u check?  the original int?","author":"慧风","time":829328006,"title":"bug",]),(["msg":"hmm, i checked the code, it seems fine,u should be able to get it, i'm not sure what happend, if u still can't get it, let me know, best grab a wiz online.","time":829432809,"author":"丁","title":"re: above",]),(["msg":"Ding,I guess the code has already been updated by dts when u checked..hmm","author":"慧风","time":829680191,"title":"re:above",]),(["msg":"I was killed by the huizhen in the second floor of cang jing ge threetimes. He said I entered it by killing people, but I have the letter with me, and have never killed other people.Now I am wondering what happens here.  Does huizhen will check yourskill when you enter the cang jing ge?  And will he kill you if someof your skills are under 5under level 50?   If it is the case, then whyqingle give me the letter without checking my skills?  Qingle saysI can enter the cang jing ge freely with the letter, but huizhen justtry to kill you, I was killed with only 1 slash by him!!!If it is designed as this, then I will say the designer is really a... If it is a bug, then what do you wizs need to compensate me?I lost 13200 exp by these three kills, and my level is down by 3.You wizs will punish those who benefit from bugs, so what do youdo to those who suffer from your bugs?If I am totally wrong, could you also give me an explanation aboutthese accidents?Thanks a lot.Kat,","author":"慧风","time":829680268,"title":"A BUG?",]),(["msg":"Is robot allowed in XKX?Kat is a robot as he is so silent while people saying he is robot.Especially midnight, he has no response at all.Can wizards be clear -> If robot is allowed?kongming.","time":829700900,"author":"空名","title":"Is robot allowed in this MUD?",]),(["msg":"Kat is a robot.","time":829703848,"author":"净鲜","title":"Agree 空名",]),(["msg":"Robot is not allowed on this mud. If we have got any evidence of usingrobot. The players file will be purged.","author":"缥渺魔君","time":829708037,"title":"Re[9][10]",]),(["msg":"why did shaolin wuji can be read to 51 only?what about those who had read to 101?one night difference! please change it back. Unfair: 1) need higher skills to get in. when get in can't read at all.	   Does not make sense!	2) the monk inside killed me 2 times without reason (bug?)	   With danger of my life to go in, can only read to 51??Rock","time":829727282,"author":"慧星","title":"wizards: help!",]),(["msg":"Different wuji has different up limit. If you feel it is unfair, go toread damo-jian, its limit is 101.  The bonze just wants to kill others,you've died twice, I've died three times with enable dodge none, enablesword none.","time":829727784,"author":"慧风","title":"re 12",]),(["msg":"I would be even quieter now, because my chat will be closed forever.Want to talk with me, use tell.  Quiet means robot, no problem,I will be the master of